OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CNuclear test veterans will get full    
OL,5,Ctruth, says Burnham, as he confirms    
OL,6,Cindependent panel                      
OL,7,GAndy Burnham has told nuclear test     
OL,8,Gveterans they will get "the full       
OL,9,Gtruth" as he confirmed plans for an    
OL,10,Ginvestigation into the health legacy   
OL,11,Gof Britain's Cold War-era atomic       
OL,12,Gprogramme.                             
OL,14,FThe prime minister has ordered an      
OL,15,Findependent panel modelled on the      
OL,16,FHillsborough disaster investigation to 
OL,17,Fassess the potential impact of testing 
OL,18,Fexercises in the 1950s and 1960s.      
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
