OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CDisability benefit review calls for    
OL,5,Ccloser link with claimant costs        
OL,6,GThe main disability benefit in England 
OL,7,Gand Wales should be more closely       
OL,8,Glinked to the additional costs         
OL,9,Gclaimants face, a government-          
OL,10,Gcommissioned review has recommended.   
OL,12,FThe review on personal independence    
OL,13,Fpayment (Pip) led by Disability        
OL,14,FMinister Sir Stephen Timms said the    
OL,15,Fcurrent system was "not appropriate"   
OL,16,Ffor claimants who do not have any      
OL,17,Fextra costs arising from their         
OL,18,Fcondition.                             
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
